WEBVTT

00:33.580 --> 00:37.020
=Royal Upstart 2=
(Based on "Zhenguan Foolish Son-in-Law")

00:37.325 --> 00:39.885
=Episode 7=

00:39.885 --> 00:42.450
(This fool's mouth
could infuriate His Majesty)

00:43.650 --> 00:44.730
(Ministry of Justice Prison)
What does your father mean?

00:44.730 --> 00:46.090
Why did he seal up my shop?

00:46.100 --> 00:48.330
We're just selling glaze, and now
your father has taken an interest in it?

00:48.330 --> 00:49.410
You...

00:49.410 --> 00:50.930
What are you talking about?

00:51.060 --> 00:53.089
How could my father
possibly be interested in this?

00:55.809 --> 00:56.610
Who are you?

00:58.729 --> 01:01.770
This is the steward from my residence.

01:03.570 --> 01:05.130
The steward of the Princess's residence?

01:06.930 --> 01:08.730
No wonder you carry yourself so well.

01:09.800 --> 01:12.030
When the time comes, I'll go
to your residence to propose marriage.

01:12.040 --> 01:13.489
Can you help me persuade His Majesty?

01:13.489 --> 01:14.250
You scoundrel!

01:14.250 --> 01:15.689
What are you talking about?

01:16.089 --> 01:17.129
What did I say wrong?

01:17.130 --> 01:18.630
When a man comes of age, he marries.
When a woman comes of age, she weds.

01:18.649 --> 01:19.769
What daughter doesn't get married?

01:20.170 --> 01:23.210
(How dare this fool
set his sights on my daughter.)

01:23.890 --> 01:25.049
As long as you marry me,

01:25.409 --> 01:28.009
all the shares
of my glaze workshop will be yours.

01:28.170 --> 01:29.049
Just take a look.

01:29.170 --> 01:30.170
Across all of Great Yong,

01:30.180 --> 01:31.560
who could be more generous than me?

01:34.089 --> 01:34.970
So much.

01:35.530 --> 01:36.490
All for me?

01:36.490 --> 01:37.329
This is nothing.

01:37.330 --> 01:38.180
It's really not much.

01:39.129 --> 01:39.930
Do you know,

01:40.290 --> 01:41.850
we were about to make a fortune today?

01:41.850 --> 01:43.750
So many merchants
came to place orders with me.

01:44.449 --> 01:45.530
That man from Beicang alone

01:45.570 --> 01:47.170
ordered nearly ten thousand guan.

01:47.650 --> 01:49.090
We were just about to close the deal,

01:49.129 --> 01:50.250
and then the shop got sealed.

01:51.849 --> 01:53.849
Your goods are so good,

01:54.250 --> 01:56.170
why sell them to Beicang?

01:56.370 --> 01:57.209
Brother,

01:57.370 --> 01:58.329
what do you know?

01:59.370 --> 02:01.489
This concerns major court affairs.

02:01.500 --> 02:03.220
You wouldn't understand
even if I told you.

02:05.010 --> 02:06.010
(Brother?)

02:06.090 --> 02:07.849
(I don't understand court affairs?)

02:08.090 --> 02:08.530
You...

02:08.730 --> 02:10.289
Don't flatter yourself.

02:12.650 --> 02:13.730
Your glaze,

02:13.730 --> 02:14.370
I...

02:15.090 --> 02:16.929
It really sells very well.

02:18.289 --> 02:19.970
People of Great Yong

02:20.010 --> 02:21.530
are all eager to buy from you,

02:21.569 --> 02:23.129
yet you insist on selling to Beicang.

02:23.130 --> 02:25.849
Aren't you afraid others will accuse you
of colluding with the enemy?

02:26.090 --> 02:27.370
Colluding with the enemy?

02:28.090 --> 02:29.250
Accuse me?

02:29.730 --> 02:30.890
Who would dare accuse me?

02:30.929 --> 02:33.090
I'll go straight
to His Majesty and file a complaint.

02:33.370 --> 02:35.010
I'll have his entire clan punished.

02:35.849 --> 02:36.970
Colluding with the enemy?

02:37.020 --> 02:37.929
Isn't that ridiculous?

02:40.090 --> 02:41.650
Then tell me,

02:41.810 --> 02:43.610
if any misunderstanding arises later,

02:43.610 --> 02:44.890
I can help explain it for you.

02:49.329 --> 02:49.769
Come.

02:57.449 --> 02:58.689
One glaze cup

02:58.689 --> 03:00.009
can sell for that much money.

03:00.449 --> 03:02.569
One sheep is only eighty wen.

03:02.569 --> 03:04.370
One guan can buy a whole flock of sheep.

03:04.889 --> 03:05.810
Raising a sheep

03:06.129 --> 03:07.889
takes at least a year and a half.

03:08.330 --> 03:09.930
How long does it take me to make glaze?

03:10.100 --> 03:11.650
What's more, those gemstones of theirs,

03:11.650 --> 03:13.009
I make them all from glaze scraps.

03:13.009 --> 03:14.449
There's practically no cost.

03:14.930 --> 03:16.210
If we sell these things

03:16.370 --> 03:18.650
to merchants from Beicang and Nanshuo,

03:18.670 --> 03:20.090
when foreigners spend money on them,

03:20.090 --> 03:21.770
how many cattle
and sheep must they sell?

03:22.169 --> 03:24.090
Cattle and sheep,
who do they sell them to?

03:24.530 --> 03:26.169
Isn't it still us, Great Yong?

03:26.560 --> 03:27.970
The more cattle and sheep they sell,

03:27.970 --> 03:30.449
the less money they have
to buy provisions and equipment.

03:30.490 --> 03:32.449
With just a small glaze product,

03:32.450 --> 03:35.409
we can restrain the war preparations
of Beicang and other foreign states.

03:35.729 --> 03:36.689
Isn't that clever?

03:37.770 --> 03:39.289
If they keep liking them in the future,

03:39.330 --> 03:40.370
they'll keep buying them.

03:40.490 --> 03:41.210
Before long,

03:41.210 --> 03:42.729
they won't have money left to wage war.

03:44.930 --> 03:46.050
I've heard

03:46.449 --> 03:47.889
our Great Yong border

03:47.889 --> 03:49.250
is still at war with Beicang.

03:49.250 --> 03:50.330
With my method,

03:50.569 --> 03:52.970
it won't take long
before they are too poor to fight.

03:54.370 --> 03:55.090
Good.

03:55.210 --> 03:56.009
Good!

03:57.689 --> 03:58.490
Just watch.

03:59.210 --> 04:00.449
In less than three months,

04:00.450 --> 04:02.330
they'll start selling
cattle and sheep at the border.

04:02.330 --> 04:03.090
Even

04:03.770 --> 04:05.289
their warhorses will have to be sold.

04:06.050 --> 04:06.810
Indeed.

04:07.650 --> 04:10.650
If Beicang ends up
buying large quantities,

04:10.650 --> 04:12.530
it will surely
affect their war preparations.

04:12.650 --> 04:14.689
On top of that, with Great Yong's taxes,

04:14.689 --> 04:16.790
we can also bring in
a considerable amount of revenue.

04:17.289 --> 04:18.609
As one rises and the other falls,

04:19.449 --> 04:20.090
then

04:20.330 --> 04:22.210
the conflict between
Great Yong and Beicang

04:22.930 --> 04:24.090
won't take many years.

04:24.370 --> 04:27.250
We may soon see a decisive outcome.

04:27.250 --> 04:28.590
You do have some brains after all.

04:29.490 --> 04:29.770
Girl.

04:29.770 --> 04:30.129
You...

04:30.129 --> 04:30.569
Come.

04:30.889 --> 04:32.449
I'll take you to see the glaze workshop.

04:33.569 --> 04:33.930
Oh right,

04:34.530 --> 04:35.849
that Beicang fellow,

04:35.889 --> 04:36.849
she's just a fool.

04:37.090 --> 04:38.009
Let her go.

04:38.010 --> 04:39.289
She might still be of use later.

04:42.975 --> 04:44.255
(A fool?)

04:44.370 --> 04:45.930
(And he calls others fools.)

04:46.712 --> 04:47.950
(Ministry of Justice Prison)

04:47.970 --> 04:50.930
I told you, this young master just doesn't
have the fortune for wealth.

04:51.210 --> 04:52.569
He offended the Princess.

04:52.569 --> 04:54.390
If he wasn't arrested,
that would be strange.

04:54.409 --> 04:55.169
Young Madam.

04:55.930 --> 04:56.689
How is it?

04:56.810 --> 04:57.849
The guard just said

04:58.330 --> 05:00.289
the young master
was taken away by the Princess.

05:02.570 --> 05:03.330
Young Madam.

05:04.210 --> 05:04.690
Taken...

05:05.010 --> 05:06.010
Taken away?

05:12.330 --> 05:12.890
Boss,

05:12.890 --> 05:13.690
you're back.

05:13.790 --> 05:15.330
Young Madam was worried sick just now.

05:16.570 --> 05:18.450
Didn't I tell her not to worry?

05:19.210 --> 05:20.570
Hurry and go inform her.

05:21.090 --> 05:21.570
Alright.

05:29.929 --> 05:30.890
This bowl

05:31.609 --> 05:33.570
wrapped in a glaze as thin as gauze,

05:33.809 --> 05:35.090
layer upon layer,

05:35.369 --> 05:36.369
yet never cloudy.

05:36.729 --> 05:37.890
A fine piece.

05:38.010 --> 05:39.249
This is no mere bowl.

05:39.260 --> 05:41.990
This is clearly a treasure meant to be
passed down through generations.

05:42.570 --> 05:43.450
Impressive, isn't it?

05:46.090 --> 05:48.450
Your glaze workshop is doing very well.

05:48.570 --> 05:49.729
You should keep it going.

05:49.849 --> 05:52.609
You've solved
a major crisis for the court.

05:54.530 --> 05:56.330
Do you need any reward?

05:57.729 --> 05:58.369
A reward?

05:58.770 --> 05:59.609
What reward?

05:59.729 --> 06:00.369
From whom?

06:00.530 --> 06:02.369
I will submit a memorial to His Majesty.

06:03.500 --> 06:04.570
That's not necessary.

06:05.010 --> 06:06.750
He probably
won't grant anything worthwhile.

06:10.289 --> 06:11.130
If

06:12.330 --> 06:13.849
you could get me a marquis title,

06:14.609 --> 06:16.090
I'd be quite pleased.

06:16.169 --> 06:17.390
Then our statuses would match,

06:17.400 --> 06:18.809
and I could go to your
residence to propose marriage.

06:19.289 --> 06:19.729
You...

06:21.929 --> 06:24.090
A marquis title probably
can't be given to you.

06:24.809 --> 06:27.130
But if you can agree to one condition,

06:27.249 --> 06:28.369
a count title

06:28.530 --> 06:29.650
can be secured.

06:33.450 --> 06:34.210
What condition?

06:34.210 --> 06:34.849
Let's hear it.

06:35.010 --> 06:36.010
A count title works too.

06:38.330 --> 06:40.330
If you publicly say

06:40.690 --> 06:41.849
these gemstones

06:42.049 --> 06:43.570
were made by her,

06:43.690 --> 06:46.249
and from now on
you stop producing them privately,

06:46.249 --> 06:48.249
then this title will be yours.

06:48.809 --> 06:49.369
This...

06:49.650 --> 06:50.210
Alright.

06:51.010 --> 06:51.570
Fine.

06:53.169 --> 06:54.680
But you must agree
to one condition of mine.

06:54.690 --> 06:56.760
That is, the ones you produce,
these so-called gemstones,

06:56.770 --> 06:57.790
can only be sold externally,

06:57.809 --> 06:59.369
and must not interfere
with Great Yong's monetary system.

06:59.369 --> 07:02.530
(This fool even knows
to consider the court's interests.)

07:03.809 --> 07:04.489
Sure.

07:05.369 --> 07:07.130
Girl, in a while I'll have someone

07:07.130 --> 07:08.890
deliver the money
earned this morning to you.

07:08.900 --> 07:09.849
Didn't your family need money?

07:10.010 --> 07:10.729
Use it first.

07:10.929 --> 07:11.690
But it's agreed,

07:11.929 --> 07:12.609
later on,

07:12.609 --> 07:13.650
we still split it evenly.

07:14.450 --> 07:15.130
Also,

07:15.409 --> 07:16.809
these glaze-making techniques,

07:17.000 --> 07:18.169
I'll teach them to you later.

07:21.130 --> 07:22.249
It's nothing complicated,

07:22.530 --> 07:23.650
not worth much anyway.

07:25.049 --> 07:26.489
Not worth much?

07:27.190 --> 07:28.729
Look at you, with such little ambition.

07:30.090 --> 07:31.369
So beautiful.

07:43.890 --> 07:45.770
I'll take all the items the steward

07:46.210 --> 07:47.049
is holding.

07:47.090 --> 07:48.169
Give me your lowest price.

07:48.169 --> 07:49.409
Didn't you say you needed money?

07:49.570 --> 07:50.849
These are meant for the wealthy.

07:52.030 --> 07:53.289
It's useful for him to buy them.

07:55.010 --> 07:55.609
Alright.

07:56.609 --> 07:57.369
Just name a price.

07:57.700 --> 07:59.489
But you're not allowed
to sell them outside.

08:00.049 --> 08:01.010
Name a price?

08:02.130 --> 08:02.929
Just name one.

08:03.030 --> 08:04.760
They're all
from our own household anyway.

08:04.770 --> 08:05.409
Five guan.

08:06.409 --> 08:06.849
Five...

08:07.010 --> 08:07.650
What?

08:08.249 --> 08:09.409
Five guan?

08:10.450 --> 08:10.929
This...

08:12.729 --> 08:13.809
These things,

08:13.809 --> 08:15.929
if sold outside,
how much would they fetch?

08:17.520 --> 08:19.020
Two or three thousand guan, I suppose.

08:19.030 --> 08:19.970
I didn't look too closely.

08:20.970 --> 08:21.409
(These...)

08:22.130 --> 08:23.809
(Hundreds of times the profit.)

08:24.130 --> 08:26.409
(This kid isn't making money at all.)

08:26.450 --> 08:27.729
(He's practically taking money.)

08:29.010 --> 08:31.130
Then tomorrow just wait
at home to receive your title.

08:31.929 --> 08:33.049
Is that true?

08:33.210 --> 08:34.849
Aren't you the unfavored princess?

08:34.929 --> 08:36.130
Why do I feel

08:36.249 --> 08:37.729
this sounds unreliable?

08:38.825 --> 08:40.275
(Wei Mansion)

08:48.049 --> 08:48.849
Aunt,

08:48.970 --> 08:50.530
didn't I have someone send you word?

08:50.530 --> 08:51.770
Why are you still so anxious?

08:52.809 --> 08:55.770
Hao, I've thought about it
for a long time.

08:56.420 --> 08:58.380
Serving someone close to power
is like living with a tiger.

08:58.409 --> 08:59.570
Helping the Princess

08:59.570 --> 09:01.049
is far too dangerous.

09:01.330 --> 09:02.330
If it really comes to it,

09:02.400 --> 09:03.690
we should just hand the workshop

09:03.890 --> 09:04.809
over to the Princess.

09:06.000 --> 09:07.660
Whether we hand it
over or not makes no difference.

09:07.670 --> 09:09.169
Sooner or later,
I'll marry the Princess.

09:09.169 --> 09:10.409
We'll be family anyway.

09:15.050 --> 09:16.690
Why are you talking nonsense again?

09:16.849 --> 09:18.769
We're just ordinary people.

09:18.970 --> 09:20.729
At most, we've only
earned a bit of money.

09:20.849 --> 09:22.489
The Princess is someone far above us.

09:22.489 --> 09:24.250
How could she possibly
take a liking to you?

09:24.500 --> 09:26.570
If the royal family
hears you say things like this,

09:26.570 --> 09:27.690
it will ruin you.

09:29.330 --> 09:32.970
But I feel like the Princess
already has some feelings for me.

09:40.729 --> 09:41.529
Hao,

09:42.849 --> 09:44.290
what's gotten into you?

09:44.570 --> 09:46.570
Have you lost your mind?

09:46.570 --> 09:47.410
Aunt,

09:47.729 --> 09:49.970
anything I want to do,
I can make happen.

09:52.570 --> 09:52.970
Oh right,

09:54.090 --> 09:56.170
tomorrow morning
don't go to restaurant yet.

09:56.300 --> 09:57.249
And don't go out either.

09:57.250 --> 09:58.090
Something might happen.

09:59.090 --> 10:00.570
(What if that girl isn't reliable)

10:00.970 --> 10:02.729
(and no count title comes tomorrow?)

10:03.000 --> 10:05.090
(Wouldn't that just get
Aunt's hopes up for nothing)

10:05.210 --> 10:06.930
Did you go out and cause trouble again?

10:07.190 --> 10:08.450
Why can't it be something good?

10:08.609 --> 10:10.129
Did you get into another fight again?

10:11.729 --> 10:12.609
These past few days,

10:13.090 --> 10:14.609
I've been happiest.

10:14.970 --> 10:16.330
We don't have to pay anything back,

10:16.350 --> 10:17.769
and money keeps coming in every day.

10:17.770 --> 10:19.050
You're not allowed
to go out and cause trouble again.

10:19.050 --> 10:19.849
Do you hear me?

10:20.210 --> 10:20.970
I told you,

10:21.090 --> 10:22.170
it's something good.

10:22.210 --> 10:23.450
What good thing could it be?

10:23.450 --> 10:24.690
I told you, but you don't believe me.

10:24.690 --> 10:25.790
Then what do you want me to do?

10:26.810 --> 10:28.090
Then say it first.

10:28.570 --> 10:29.889
Let me hear it

10:30.450 --> 10:32.009
and see if I can take it.

10:36.210 --> 10:37.009
Well,

10:37.769 --> 10:39.129
I'm not completely sure yet.

10:41.330 --> 10:42.489
I might

10:42.769 --> 10:44.129
be granted a count title.

10:44.810 --> 10:45.609
A count title.

10:46.769 --> 10:47.930
What?

10:56.725 --> 10:59.555
♪Everyone says I'm a big silly fool♪

11:00.175 --> 11:03.575
♪When things happen,
I only know how to count on my fingers♪

11:04.345 --> 11:07.295
♪They shake their heads
and say I'm pitiful♪

11:07.635 --> 11:10.335
♪Sigh and walk away♪

11:11.935 --> 11:15.405
♪Little do they know,
I am sharp and bright♪

11:15.405 --> 11:17.635
♪With a heart like a mirror,
I understand the world's♪

11:17.635 --> 11:19.745
♪Colors and darkness♪

11:19.745 --> 11:21.765
♪But I keep my edge hidden♪

11:21.765 --> 11:26.125
♪The day I become famous
is just around the corner♪

11:27.565 --> 11:31.295
♪In the hotpot restaurant,
skewers boil in the broth♪

11:31.565 --> 11:35.165
♪People come and go,
with few worries or troubles♪

11:35.325 --> 11:37.405
♪The clacking of the abacus rings out♪

11:37.405 --> 11:42.195
♪See me differently.
Who dares to challenge me?♪

11:42.415 --> 11:44.035
♪The world mistakes me♪

11:44.035 --> 11:46.375
♪For an ignorant and stubborn fool♪

11:46.445 --> 11:47.635
♪As the storm approaches♪

11:47.635 --> 11:50.035
♪I just shrug and watch with a smile♪

11:50.245 --> 11:51.965
♪This foolish image is convenient♪

11:51.965 --> 11:53.945
♪I use it as a protective shield♪

11:54.115 --> 11:55.865
♪Navigating with ease, I attract♪

11:55.865 --> 11:57.965
♪A lucky star to accompany me♪

11:57.965 --> 11:59.435
♪In a peaceful golden age♪

11:59.435 --> 12:01.665
♪I hold my lady's hand
to watch the world♪

12:01.885 --> 12:03.085
♪Pouring youth and fireworks♪

12:03.085 --> 12:05.605
♪Into a precious glazed cup♪

12:05.735 --> 12:07.445
♪Having experienced life's changes♪

12:07.445 --> 12:08.725
♪And tasted its highs and lows♪

12:08.875 --> 12:10.295
♪My wish has finally come true♪

12:10.295 --> 12:11.335
♪To stay by your side♪

12:11.335 --> 12:13.255
♪In this fleeting world♪

12:13.425 --> 12:16.675
♪We are free and happy♪

12:20.675 --> 12:22.455
♪From a nobody♪

12:22.455 --> 12:24.355
♪To someone now famous♪

12:24.465 --> 12:25.895
♪Ordinary people laugh at me♪

12:25.895 --> 12:28.405
♪But I laugh at how
they cannot see through it all♪

12:28.505 --> 12:30.085
♪Let others plot and scheme♪

12:30.085 --> 12:32.155
♪I will keep my heart unchanged♪

12:32.365 --> 12:34.045
♪In this vast world♪

12:34.045 --> 12:36.045
♪I find my own leisurely freedom♪

12:36.195 --> 12:38.405
♪The world is bustling,
and things constantly change♪

12:38.405 --> 12:39.995
♪Everything ends eventually♪

12:40.085 --> 12:41.585
♪All that remains before my eyes♪

12:41.585 --> 12:43.985
♪Is this street wandering,
still tinged with pity♪

12:43.985 --> 12:45.695
♪No matter how time flies♪

12:45.695 --> 12:46.855
♪Even if the falling snow♪

12:46.855 --> 12:48.485
♪Dyes the hair at our temples white♪

12:48.485 --> 12:49.525
♪All I want now♪

12:49.525 --> 12:51.625
♪Is to pray for
my lady's peace and safety♪

12:51.625 --> 12:54.885
♪Year after year♪
